OL,4,Geverybody make cores for their own     
OL,5,Gfavorite system and the mega65 team had
OL,6,Gmade their system on the nexys4 DDR.   
OL,8,GI haven t bought an FPGA till today,   
OL,9,Gbecause if i want them all(Commodore) i
OL,10,Gneed more than one.                    
OL,12,GFor me the C65 is an successor of the  
OL,13,GC128 and not from the C64 and i am     
OL,14,Gworry about no C128 fpga system, but it
OL,15,Gcan be very useful to support the amiga
OL,16,Gcore, because                          
OL,18,G1. It is from Commodore                
OL,20,G2. A lot of Software                   
OL,22,G3. The C65 was discontinued because    
